\frac{1}{x_{\rm eq}-x_-}
\ln\!\Bigg[\frac{x-x_{\rm eq}}{x-x_-}\frac{x_-}{x_{\rm eq}}\Bigg]
=-k_r t .
}
\]

Solving for \(x(t)\) gives the integrated expression for the reversible reaction:

\[
\boxed{
